[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0366","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0366.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0356","title":"Red Hat Linux PAM NIS禁用账户访问控制漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.1 中的可插拔认证模块（PAM）存在账户锁定机制缺陷，未能正确限制对已禁用的 NIS 账户的访问权限。本地攻击者可通过 NIS 认证接口绕过账户禁用策略，利用已禁用的 NIS 账户登录系统，获取非授权访问权限。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.1 及可能使用相同 PAM 配置的其他发行版，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。攻击者需具备本地访问权限，利用难度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0356"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:32Z","remediation":"升级 Red Hat Linux 的 PAM 软件包至修复版本（如 pam-0.68-10 及以上），或升级至 Red Hat Linux 6.2 及以上版本。如无法升级，在 `/etc/pam.d/` 配置文件中确保 `pam_unix_auth.so` 和 `pam_deny.so` 模块正确配置，对禁用 NIS 账户添加 `account required pam_unix_acct.so` 规则，防止已禁用账户通过 NIS 认证绕过锁定机制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/697","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/advisory.html?id=1789","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0356.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0356.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0356","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0356.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0356.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h94w-vpj5-gw3g/GHSA-h94w-vpj5-gw3g.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0356.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c3c8c19a-b35d-42be-9b0b-f9ece5f66a0d.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0366.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0384","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0384.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0369","title":"Caldera OpenLinux 2.3 Ident Daemon 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Caldera OpenLinux 2.3 系统中的 Ident 服务守护进程存在拒绝服务漏洞。当远程攻击者向目标系统发送大量 IDENT 请求时，该守护进程会为每个请求创建独立线程进行处理，由于未对并发线程数进行有效限制，导致系统资源被迅速耗尽，最终造成服务崩溃或系统无响应。攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过网络远程触发该漏洞，攻击条件简单，危害等级中等。受影响的系统包括 Caldera OpenLinux 2.3 及可能使用相同 Ident 实现的其他 Linux 发行版。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0369"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:34Z","remediation":"建议禁用 identd 服务（identd 主要用于身份验证查询，非关键服务）：执行 `killall identd` 停止进程，并删除或注释 `/etc/inetd.conf` 中的 `auth` 或 `ident` 行，然后重启 inetd。如无法禁用，在防火墙层面阻止外部对 TCP 113 端口的访问：执行 `iptables -A INPUT -p tcp --dport 113 -j DROP`。升级到 Caldera OpenLinux 更高版本或迁移至受支持的 Linux 发行版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1266","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0369.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0369","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0369.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0369.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/74884340187670a91b9d5bdb799b52e73426ad63/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-gqwr-j5j7-xjj4/GHSA-gqwr-j5j7-xjj4.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0369.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000822.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0384.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0015","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0016","title":"True North Software Internet Anywhere Mail Server POP3 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"True North Software Internet Anywhere Mail Server 2.3.x 的 POP3 邮件服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向服务器发送超长的用户名参数触发该漏洞，可导致服务崩溃引发拒绝服务，或远程执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 2.3.x 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0016"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:49Z","remediation":"该产品已于 2000 年代初停止维护，True North Software 已不再运营。建议立即迁移至其他受支持的邮件服务器软件（如 hMailServer、MailEnable 等）。在迁移完成前，可在防火墙层面将 POP3（110/TCP）和 SMTP（25/TCP）端口限制为仅允许受信任的内部 IP 访问，并部署入侵检测规则匹配超长用户名请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/730","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19561","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ed3e8dec058a54f5d840cd78ee86185dee6350a7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0016.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0016","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0016.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9da4ebcefe304654f22bdf6c578568005410bc6c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0016.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fxfp-pxpv-xgmv/GHSA-fxfp-pxpv-xgmv.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0016.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000804.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0039","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0039.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0047","title":"多种Unix系统 Pager工具 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Yahoo Pager/Messenger 即时通讯客户端存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含超长 URL 的即时消息触发该漏洞，导致目标客户端程序崩溃，造成拒绝服务。攻击无需身份认证即可远程发起，攻击复杂度低，但仅影响客户端可用性，不涉及数据机密性与完整性。该漏洞 CVSS v2 评分为 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0047"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-10-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"Yahoo Pager/Messenger 已停止维护且官方不再提供安全更新，建议立即卸载该软件，改用其他受支持的即时通讯客户端。如因业务必须使用，应避免点击消息中来自不可信来源的超长 URL，并在网络边界配置入侵检测规则过滤异常载荷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0047.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0047.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0047","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/9ac7749a22b1a691cfc0ca6848298302540b252b/2000/CVE-2000-0047.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/412d717d6f053499cbceb993220b04e36c6778d7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x9vv-mwp3-687q/GHSA-x9vv-mwp3-687q.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0047.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88251/info.html","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-0047.md","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--22bf2394-b73c-495c-8a4d-dc998ccdbb16.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0039.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0411","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0411.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0489","title":"FreeBSD NetBSD OpenBSD setsockopt 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 5.0、NetBSD 1.4.2 及 OpenBSD 2.7 操作系统的 setsockopt() 系统调用存在资源耗尽漏洞。本地攻击者可通过 socketpair() 函数创建大量 socket 对，再利用 setsockopt() 为每个 socket 设置极大的缓冲区大小，随后持续向这些 socket 写入大容量数据，导致内核内存被迅速耗尽，最终触发系统拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可利用，影响三个 BSD 系操作系统的多个版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0489"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:50Z","remediation":"建议立即将 FreeBSD 升级至 5.3 及以上版本（含 setsockopt 系统调用缓冲区大小限制修复），将 NetBSD 升级至 1.5 及以上版本，将 OpenBSD 升级至 2.8 及以上版本。若无法升级，可在 /etc/login.conf 中通过设置 datasize-cur 和 datasize-max 限制进程数据段大小，并在内核参数中调低 kern.ipc.somaxconn 和 net.inet.tcp.sendbuf_max 以限制 socket 缓冲区上限，从而缓解大量 socketpair 耗尽内核内存的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/622","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=NCBBKFKDOLAGKIAPMILPCEJLCEAA.labs%40ussrback.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.10.9908270039010.16315-100000%40thetis.deor.org","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3298","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19488","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0489.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0489","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0489.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d927d63ee32587ef80d9e763226701b1dc32c67d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0489.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/64db5db4a6681c330f93cc62718610a5bc70bd7a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-58qg-hjfp-7643/GHSA-58qg-hjfp-7643.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0489.md","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/tools/cve-details/cve-details.ipynb","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--67b9ce69-a3be-4158-b681-9d3529c7897e.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0411.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0329","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0329.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0328","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 TCP 可预测初始序列号漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 系统生成的 TCP 初始序列号（ISN）存在可预测性漏洞，其随机数生成算法存在缺陷，导致攻击者能够预测后续连接的序列号。远程攻击者可在无需认证的情况下，通过预测 ISN 伪造 TCP 连接或劫持已有会话，从而冒充可信主机执行未授权操作。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 所有版本，攻击者仅需掌握目标网络可达性即可发起攻击，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0328"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-08-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:29Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-029 对应的修补程序（KB259728），或升级至 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 6a。对于无法安装补丁的遗留系统，建议在网络边界防火墙上启用 TCP 序列号随机化（如设置 ip tcp-random-seq），并部署入侵检测系统监控 TCP 会话劫持行为作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/604","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=4.1.19990824165629.00abcb40%40192.168.124.1","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-046","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0328.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0328","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0328.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0328.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ad1f28a6575460b2b8dc02e086c9a35eb31ea1f4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pwww-664m-pfp9/GHSA-pwww-664m-pfp9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0328.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-656.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8ce591a6-a76c-4f3f-ba09-ca14e35b7720.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0329.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0999","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0999.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0374","title":"Caldera Linux kdm 默认配置信息泄露漏洞","description":"Caldera 和 Mandrake Linux 发行版中 KDM（KDE 显示管理器）的默认配置存在安全漏洞，允许来自任意主机的 XDMCP（X 显示管理器控制协议）连接。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用此漏洞，通过 XDMCP 协议连接到目标系统，获取敏感信息或绕过额外的访问限制。该漏洞影响 Caldera、Mandrake Linux 及其他可能使用相同默认配置的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0374"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-08-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:35Z","remediation":"立即修改 kdm 的 Xaccess 配置文件（通常位于 /etc/X11/xdm/Xaccess），将默认的允许任意主机连接改为仅允许受信任的 IP 地址段，或直接注释掉所有非本地的 XDMCP 条目。如无需远程图形登录功能，可在 /etc/inetd.conf 或 xdm 配置中完全禁用 XDMCP 服务。同时升级到 Caldera OpenLinux 安全公告 CSSA-1999-021 或 Mandrake MDKSA-2002:025 中指定的修复版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:025","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1446","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4856","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0374.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0374","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0374/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0374.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0374.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a63d131cc61df62c077c7700617ad6343ec52ef/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-fm67-m334-93w3/GHSA-fm67-m334-93w3.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0374.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0999.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0364","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0364.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0355","title":"SuSE pbpg 1.x 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"SuSE Linux 的 pbpg 1.x 软件包中的 pg 和 pb 命令存在任意文件读取漏洞，由于程序未对文件路径参数进行充分过滤和权限检查，本地攻击者可通过向 pg 或 pb 命令传递特制文件路径参数，读取系统上任意文件内容，包括敏感配置文件、密码文件等。该漏洞影响 SuSE Linux 系统中安装了 pbpg 1.x 软件包的系统，攻击者需要拥有本地 shell 访问权限即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0355"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-08-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:32Z","remediation":"立即升级 SuSE Linux 中的 pbpg 软件包至 2.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 pg 和 pb 命令的任意文件读取漏洞。如无法升级，可卸载 pbpg 软件包（rpm -e pbpg），或通过文件权限限制 pg/pb 命令仅允许 root 用户执行（chmod 700 /usr/bin/pg /usr/bin/pb）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_21.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0355.json","