本。对于仍在运行 Apache 1.3 系列的服务器，应立即升级至 2.4 系列最新稳定版（如 2.4.62），该漏洞已在 1.3.11 中修复。如无法升级，在 httpd.conf 中禁用 mod_rewrite 和 mod_vhost_alias 模块作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.apacheweek.com/issues/00-01-07#status","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5419c9ba0951ef73a655362403d12bb8d10fab38274deb3f005816f5%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5f9c22f9c28adbd9f00556059edc7b03a5d5bb71d4bb80257c0d34e4%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f834890708bf6920%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rb9c9f42dafa25d2f669dac2a536a03f2575bc5ec1be6f480618aee10%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf2f0f3611f937cf6cfb3b4fe4a67f69885855126110e1e3f2fb2728e%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf6449464fd8b7437704c55f88361b66f12d5b5f90bcce66af4be4ba9%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1206.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1206","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1206.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1206.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1206.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1206.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/967da9d6d460202310d5ea881594506ef29aa587/2000/CVE-2000-1206.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1206.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1206.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1206.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1148.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0271","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0271.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0325","title":"Microsoft JET 数据库引擎 VBA Shell命令执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft JET 数据库引擎（3.5/3.51/4.0 版本）在处理数据库查询时存在 VBA Shell 命令执行漏洞。攻击者在拥有本地访问权限的条件下，可通过构造包含恶意 VBA Shell 命令的数据库查询语句，利用 JET 引擎对 VBA 函数的不当调用机制，在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响使用 Microsoft JET 数据库引擎的多种应用程序，攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制数据库文件等方式触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0325"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-08-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:28Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-033 对应补丁，或升级至 MDAC 2.1 SP1 及以上版本。如无法打补丁，可通过注册表禁用 Jet 数据库引擎中的 VBA 函数调用：将 `HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Jet\\4.0\\Engines\\SandBoxMode` 设置为 3（完全沙盒模式）。建议升级至受支持的操作系统版本，因旧版 JET 引擎已停止安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/548","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-030","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3155","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19435","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0325.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0325.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0325","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0325.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6