ne 通过 lynx 浏览器获取该文件时，会从恶意 Web 服务器下载 uudecoded 格式的恶意载荷，随后 Pine 在处理过程中执行该载荷，导致任意命令执行。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，可完全控制目标系统，影响所有使用 Pine 4.x 版本的系统和用户。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0353"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-06-28T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:32Z","remediation":"升级 Pine 至 4.21 或更高版本，该版本已修复通过 index.html 自动调用 lynx 下载并执行恶意文件的漏洞。如无法升级，在 Pine 配置中禁用 auto-html-parsing 选项，并移除或限制 Pine 对 lynx 等外部程序的调用权限，同时在邮件客户端层面禁止自动渲染 HTML 附件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/pine_update_announcement.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_6.html","http://www.securiteam.com/unixfocus/HHP-Pine_remote_exploit.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1247","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0353.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0353","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0353.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0353.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ccp8-f5cx-4p8g/GHSA-ccp8-f5cx-4p8g.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0353.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fbab718b-0c6e-49bf-a5f8-ce372a5cd908.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--fbab718b-0c6e-49bf-a5f8-ce372a5cd908.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0908.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0103","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0118","title":"RedHat Linux su 登录失败日志绕过漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 5.2 i386/6.0 中 su 程序存在日志绕过漏洞。当 su 进程在超时前被强制终止时，系统不会记录失败的密码尝试日志，导致本地攻击者可通过暴力破解方式反复尝试密码而不被审计系统发现。该漏洞降低了暴力破解的门槛，影响 Red Hat Linux 5.2 及 6.0 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0118"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1999-06-09T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 Red Hat Linux 6.1 及以上版本，该版本已修复 su 程序在超时前被终止时不记录失败密码的问题。如无法升级，建议使用 sudo 替代 su 进行权限切换，并启用 auditd 审计日志记录所有认证事件，同时限制本地用户登录的并发会话数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94935300520617&w=2","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19255"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0535","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0535.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0481","title":"KDE Kmail 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0481是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0481"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:49Z","remediation":"升级 KDE KMail 至最新稳定版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复；无法立即升级时，可禁用自动加载邮件附件功能，或在邮件客户端中配置过滤器拦截来自不可信发件人的带附件邮件，以防止远程攻击者通过超长文件名附件触发缓冲区溢出导致拒绝服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=82&date=2000-06-22&msg=00060200422401.01667%40lez","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1380","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4993","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b7ad02cdea30b1d567c45050de3359436fcc903a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0481.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0481","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/71599ef996ac7c3f46a42cd5f524fb7576cf8be7/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0481.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/440b4085dc6f68870cd0bf207bbc8dd57d0fd487/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0481.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/812e13284092701ac2e48a9865618a02a3b2d95e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ccxh-933v-rq23/GHSA-ccxh-933v-rq23.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0481.md","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/tools/cve-details/cve-details.ipynb","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153500_153600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0481.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5ca6b19b-34f1-46b8-a88d-7ae0ce512e95.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0535.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0390","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0390.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0373","title":"KDE kvt 格式化字符串漏洞","description":"KDE kvt 终端模拟器存在格式化字符串漏洞，由于程序在处理用户输入时未正确过滤格式化字符串参数，导致本地攻击者可通过向 kvt 程序传递特制的格式化字符串参数触发该漏洞，覆盖任意内存地址，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 KDE 1.x 及更早版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可提权至 root，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0373"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:34Z","remediation":"升级 KDE 至 1.1.2 或更高版本以修复 kvt 终端程序中的格式化字符串漏洞。Red Hat Linux 用户应安装 RHSA-1999:015-01 更新包；Caldera OpenLinux 用户应应用 CSSA-1999-015.0 安全补丁。临时缓解措施可移除 kvt 的 setuid root 权限位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/kvt），限制本地普通用户以 root 权限执行该程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA1999015_01.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2266","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0373.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0373","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0373.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0373.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a63d131cc61df62c077c7700617ad6343ec52ef/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-33jv-3p35-h2qx/GHSA-33jv-3p35-h2qx.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1700/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0373.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8b470d23-25ef-40ac-9c6e-aed4ef3d2eb6.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/